	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 6th level, you are able to provide your allies with almost subconscious commands which provide them with your leadership. Whenever you use a martial maneuver that puts you into a stance, you can share the benefit of that stance with up to 4 other creatures until the start of your next turn.</p><p>In addition, allies within your aura can use your Charisma modifier as a bonus to initiative checks.</p>",
